// Commercial configuration for the paid and Setapp builds (SPEC-v2 §14.2.3). Public values only.
// xcconfig treats // as a comment: write // inside a value as /$()/ (for example in a base64 key).
// A placeholder fails Release builds and warns in Debug (scripts/check_commercial_config.sh, §14.3).

